The TV card layouts, dimensions, colors, dismiss graphics, background gradient
and adapted banner/icon rendering methods originate from AOSP TV Recents and
were initially extracted/adapted from NVIDIA Shield 9.0.0 SystemUI for local
compatibility work. They have been modified for this standalone Android 15
component. The existing NVIDIA or LineageOS SystemUI binary is not distributed.

Upstream layout and rendering code:
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-7.1.2_r1/packages/SystemUI/res/layout-television/recents_tv_task_card_view.xml
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-7.1.2_r1/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/recents/tv/views/TaskCardView.java

The following PNG assets match AOSP byte-for-byte:
